{"id":"dada5c223e508373","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-finite-graph.md","title":"Finite Directed and Undirected Graphs","display":"df-finite-graph — Finite Directed and Undirected Graphs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-finite-graph","aliases":["28-df-finite-graph"],"display":"df-finite-graph — Finite Directed and Undirected Graphs","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-finite-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-finite-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-graph — Finite Directed and Undirected Graphs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；图顶点采用有限自然数集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{DGraph}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span> 为下式构造的集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=|V|\">\\(r=|V|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;v_r\">\\(v_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;v_r\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的唯一严格递增枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\">\\([r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,s,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,s,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；只有端点编码的调用要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in V\">\\(s,t\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为自然数的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；字串相邻表示连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 表示依次连接，空连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>。字串坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 起；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1[P]\">\\(\\mathbf1[P]\\)</span> 为命题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0/1\">\\(0/1\\)</span> 指示数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}\">\\(\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}\">\\(\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}\">\\(\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}\\)</span> 均由下式定义；图带阈值与图带端点的调用域分别在下式给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DGraph}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(V,E)\\mid V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|V|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{UGraph}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(V,E)\\mid V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|V|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land E\\subseteq\\{e\\subseteq V\\mid|e|=2\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DGraph}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(V,E)\\mid V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|V|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{UGraph}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(V,E)\\mid V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|V|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land E\\subseteq\\{e\\subseteq V\\mid|e|=2\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(r)\\mathop{\\frown}_{i=1}^{r}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(v_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(r)\\mathop{\\frown}_{i=1}^{r}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(v_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)&amp;\\in\\Sigma^{r^2},&amp;\\quad\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)_{(i-1)r+j}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[(v_i,v_j)\\in E]&amp;&amp;\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ i,j\\in[r]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)&amp;\\in\\Sigma^{r^2},&amp;\\quad\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)_{(i-1)r+j}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[i\\ne j\\land\\{v_i,v_j\\}\\in E]&amp;&amp;\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ i,j\\in[r]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)&amp;\\in\\Sigma^{r^2},&amp;\\quad\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)_{(i-1)r+j}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[(v_i,v_j)\\in E]&amp;&amp;\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ i,j\\in[r]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)&amp;\\in\\Sigma^{r^2},&amp;\\quad\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)_{(i-1)r+j}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[i\\ne j\\land\\{v_i,v_j\\}\\in E]&amp;&amp;\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ i,j\\in[r]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}(G)\\coloneqq0\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\coloneqq1\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}(G)\\coloneqq0\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\coloneqq1\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}:\\mathrm{DGraph}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}:\\mathrm{UGraph}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}:\\mathrm{DGraph}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}:\\mathrm{UGraph}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}(G)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(s)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(t)\\qquad(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ s,t\\in V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}(G)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(s)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(t)\\qquad(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ s,t\\in V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>限制为自然数顶点保证图族是可编码的集合；任意抽象有限图可经有限编号得到此表示。无向图为简单图，有向图允许自环。复杂性结论使用这里的标准有效表示，任意不可计算的注入编码不能替代它。</p>\n<p>来源核对：图的邻接矩阵表示见例2.3、定理4.18证明；印刷40、89页；PDF66、115页。本原子明确编号集合以消除任意集合顶点的编码缺口。</p>\n<p>本次内容补全：图类别和自然数顶点标签保持不变；上式给出原有顶点表、邻接矩阵及二进制字段约定的具体实现。顶点数、各整数前缀长度和矩阵长度唯一确定字段边界。空顶点集的表与矩阵允许为空；有向/无向首标签避免跨类别混淆。编码像可由顺序扫描和重复定位在对数工作空间检查，合法编码中的字段也可逐位解析；按此显式表示重新编号、取补图为多项式时间操作。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"r=|V|","display":false},{"tex":"v_1<\\cdots<v_r","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"[r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k,s,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1[P]","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"0/1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DGraph}&\\coloneqq\\{(V,E)\\mid V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|V|<\\aleph_0\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{UGraph}&\\coloneqq\\{(V,E)\\mid V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|V|<\\aleph_0\\land E\\subseteq\\{e\\subseteq V\\mid|e|=2\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(r)\\mathop{\\frown}_{i=1}^{r}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(v_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)&\\in\\Sigma^{r^2},&\\quad\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)_{(i-1)r+j}&\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[(v_i,v_j)\\in E]&&\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ i,j\\in[r]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)&\\in\\Sigma^{r^2},&\\quad\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)_{(i-1)r+j}&\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[i\\ne j\\land\\{v_i,v_j\\}\\in E]&&\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\ i,j\\in[r]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}(G)\\coloneqq0\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm D}(G)\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\coloneqq1\\operatorname{vert}_{\\mathrm G}(V)\\operatorname{mat}_{\\mathrm U}(G)\\quad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}:\\mathrm{DGraph}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}:\\mathrm{UGraph}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DGST}}(G,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{DG}}(G)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(s)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm G}(t)\\qquad(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph},\\ s,t\\in V).","display":true}],"bytes":3995,"backlinks":[{"id":"1e536fad96aebabd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}$ (有限简单无向图, see [[28-df-finite-graph]])"},{"id":"9796412f33541cd3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UGraph}$ 与 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]；$G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{COL}}$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"bb808e04195f2bc5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UGraph}$ 与单射图编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]；$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}$ 由下式指定。"},{"id":"9b48ca7c5c96f8c5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UGraph}$ 与图及非负整数阈值的编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]；$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{IS}}$ 由下式指定。"},{"id":"45e118fdc159a03d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{DGraph}$ (有限有向图, see [[28-df-finite-graph]])"},{"id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"旋转映射把一条边的两个端口相互交换，故要求对合，而不仅是任意置换。固定端口表示一个自环；同一对顶点可由多个端口相连。对合给出端口之间的双射，从而得到乘数对称性；端口按终点分组得到每列总数 $D$。这与本书第21章允许自环和重边的模型对应，不复用只含简单无向图的 [[28-df-finite-graph]]。"},{"id":"17335df21f7731bf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}$ (有限简单无向图, see [[28-df-finite-graph]])"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"图问题：[[28-df-finite-graph]]、[[28-df-clique]]、[[28-df-vertex-cover]]、[[28-df-independent-set]]、[[28-df-hamiltonian-cycle]]、[[28-df-graph-coloring]]、[[28-df-set-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}